#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Om Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti er udviklet som en komplet grafløsning baseret på RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) og grafløsning. Målet er at gøre netværksadministratorens arbejde lettere ved at tage sig af alle de vigtige detaljer, der skal til for at oprette meningsfulde grafer."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Se det officielle %sCacti-websted%s for oplysninger om, hvordan du bruger Cacti, får support og opdateringer."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Aktive udviklere"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Udviklere, der arbejder på Cacti, dets arkitektur, dokumentation og fremtidige udgivelser."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Hædrende omtale"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Bidragydere til dokumentation, kvalitetssikring, pakkehåndtering, fora og vores YouTube-side."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Emeritusmedlemmer"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Medlemmer af den oprindelige Cacti Group, som siden er gået videre i deres karrierer.  Vi ønsker dem fortsat alt det bedste."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Tak"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "En særlig tak til %sTobi Oetiker%s, skaberen af %sRRDtool%s og den meget populære %sMRTG%s."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Brugerne af Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Især alle, der har taget sig tid til at oprette en fejlrapport eller på anden måde hjulpet med at løse Cacti-relaterede problemer. Også tak til alle, der har bidraget til at støtte Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licens"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti er udgivet under GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Dette program er fri software; du kan videredistribuere det og/eller ændre det under betingelserne i GNU General Public License som udgivet af Free Software Foundation; enten version 2 af licensen eller (efter eget valg) en senere version."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Dette program distribueres i håb om, at det vil være nyttigt, men UDEN NOGEN GARANTI; uden endda den underforståede garanti for SALGBARHED eller EGNETHED TIL ET BESTEMT FORMÅL. Se GNU General Public License for flere detaljer."

