msgstr "Gitterindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:836
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Enhedsgitterværdi (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php:840
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Angiver eksponentværdien på Y-aksen for tal. Bemærk: Denne indstilling er forældet og erstattet af indstillingen --y-grid.  Med denne indstilling vises Y-aksens gitterlinjer ved hvert gitterintervaltrin.  Etiketter placeres for hver etiketfaktor-linje."

#: include/global_form.php:844
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Enhedseksponentværdi (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php:848
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Hvilken enhed Cacti skal bruge på y-aksen. Brug 3 til at vise alt i \"k\" eller -6 til at vise alt i \"u\" (mikro)."

#: include/global_form.php:852
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Enhedslængde (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:857
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Hvor mange cifre skal RRDtool antage, at y-aksens etiketter har? Du skal muligvis bruge denne indstilling for at skabe nok plads, når du begynder at justere y-aksens etikettering."

#: include/global_form.php:860
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Ingen gittertilpasning (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php:863
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "For at undgå sløringseffekter fra anti-aliasing fastlåser RRDtool punkter til enhedens opløsningspixels, hvilket giver et skarpere udseende. Hvis det ikke falder i din smag, kan du bruge denne indstilling til at slå denne adfærd fra.<br><strong>Bemærk: </strong>Gittertilpasning er som standard slået fra for PDF-, EPS- og SVG-output."

#: include/global_form.php:866
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Alternativt Y-gitter (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php:869
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Algoritmen sikrer, at du altid har et gitter, at der er nok, men ikke for mange gitterlinjer, og at gitteret er metrisk. Denne parameter sikrer også, at der vises nok decimaler, selv om din graf går fra 69,998 til 70,001.<br><strong>Bemærk: </strong>Denne parameter kan komme i konflikt med indstillingerne for --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php:872
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Akseindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:877
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Højre akse (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:882
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "En anden akse tegnes til højre for grafen. Den er knyttet til venstre akse via parametrene scale og shift."

#: include/global_form.php:885
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Etiket for højre akse (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:890
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Etiketten for højre akse."

#: include/global_form.php:893
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Format for højre akse (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:898
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Som standard bestemmes formatet på akseetiketterne automatisk.  Hvis du selv vil bestemme det, så brug denne indstilling med de samme %lf-argumenter, som du kender fra kommandoerne PRINT og GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:901
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formatering af højre akse (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:906
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Når du opsætter mærkning af højre akse, anvendes en regel på dataformatet.  Understøttede formater omfatter \"numeric\", hvor data behandles som tal, \"timestamp\", hvor værdier fortolkes som UNIX-tidsstempler (antal sekunder siden januar 1970) og udtrykkes i strftime-format (standard er \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Se også --units-length og --right-axis-format.  Endelig \"duration\", hvor værdier fortolkes som varighed i millisekunder.  Formateringen følger reglerne for valstrfduration-kvalificeret PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:909
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formatering af venstre akse (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:914
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Når du opsætter mærkning af venstre akse, anvendes en regel på dataformatet.  Understøttede formater omfatter \"numeric\", hvor data behandles som tal, \"timestamp\", hvor værdier fortolkes som UNIX-tidsstempler (antal sekunder siden januar 1970) og udtrykkes i strftime-format (standard er \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Se også --units-length.  Endelig \"duration\", hvor værdier fortolkes som varighed i millisekunder.  Formateringen følger reglerne for valstrfduration-kvalificeret PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:917
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Indstillinger for signaturforklaring"

#: include/global_form.php:922
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Automatisk udfyldning"

#: include/global_form.php:926
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Udfyld tekst, så signaturforklaring og grafdata altid flugter. Bemærk: Dette kan medføre, at det tager længere tid at tegne graferne på grund af den større belastning. Automatisk udfyldning er desuden ikke nøjagtig på alle typer grafer; ensartet etikettering hjælper normalt."

#: include/global_form.php:929
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Dynamiske etiketter (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php:932
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Tegn linjemarkører som en linje."

#: include/global_form.php:935
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Gennemtving signaturforklaring for regler (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php:938
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Gennemtving generering af signaturforklaringer for HRULE og VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php:941
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Tabulatorbredde (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:946
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Som standard er tabulatorbredden 40 pixels. Brug denne indstilling til at ændre den."

#: include/global_form.php:949
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Placering af signaturforklaring (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:953
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Placér signaturforklaringen på den angivne side af grafen."

#: include/global_form.php:956
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Retning af signaturforklaring (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:960
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Placér elementerne i signaturforklaringen i den angivne lodrette rækkefølge."

#: include/global_form.php:967 lib/api_aggregate.php:1902 lib/html.php:1534
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Type af grafelement"

#: include/global_form.php:971
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Hvordan data for dette element repræsenteres visuelt på grafen."

#: include/global_form.php:986
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Den datakilde, der skal bruges til dette grafelement."

#: include/global_form.php:993
msgid "The color to use for the legend."
msgstr "Den farve, der skal bruges til signaturforklaringen."

#: include/global_form.php:996
msgid "Opacity/Alpha Channel"
msgstr "Opacitet/alfakanal"

#: include/global_form.php:1000
msgid "The opacity/alpha channel of the color."
msgstr "Farvens opacitet/alfakanal."

#: include/global_form.php:1003 lib/rrd.php:4775
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Konsolideringsfunktion"

#: include/global_form.php:1007
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Hvordan data for dette element repræsenteres statistisk på grafen."

#: include/global_form.php:1010
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "CDEF-funktion"

#: include/global_form.php:1015
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "En CDEF-funktion (matematik), der skal anvendes på dette element på grafen eller signaturforklaringen."

#: include/global_form.php:1018
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "VDEF-funktion"

#: include/global_form.php:1023
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "En VDEF-funktion (matematik), der skal anvendes på dette element i grafens signaturforklaring."

#: include/global_form.php:1026
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Forskyd data"

#: include/global_form.php:1029
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Forskyd dine data på tidsaksen (x-aksen) med den mængde, der er angivet i feltet 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php:1037
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Værdien af grafelementet.<br/> [TICK]: Brøkdelen for mærkelinjen.<br/> [SHIFT]: Tidsforskydningen i sekunder."

#: include/global_form.php:1040
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "GPRINT-type"

#: include/global_form.php:1044
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Hvis dette grafelement er en GPRINT, kan du eventuelt vælge et andet format her. Du kan definere yderligere typer under \"GPRINT Presets\"."

#: include/global_form.php:1047
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Tekstjustering (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php:1052
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Alle efterfølgende linjer i signaturforklaringen justeres som angivet her.  Du kan bruge denne kommando flere gange i samme graf.  Denne kommando skaber ikke et tabellayout.<br/><strong>Bemærk: </strong>Du vil måske indsætte en &lt;HR&gt; på det foregående grafelement.<br/> <strong>Bemærk: </strong>En &lt;HR&gt; på denne linje i signaturforklaringen gør denne indstilling overflødig!"

#: include/global_form.php:1055
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Tekstformat"

#: include/global_form.php:1060
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Tekst, der vises i signaturforklaringen for dette grafelement."

#: include/global_form.php:1063
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Indsæt hårdt linjeskift"

#: include/global_form.php:1066
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Tvinger signaturforklaringen til næste linje efter dette element."

#: include/global_form.php:1069
msgid "Line Width"
msgstr "Linjebredde"

#: include/global_form.php:1074
msgid "LINE1, LINE2 and LINE3 use fixed widths. For LINE:STACK, enter a width in pixels; integers or decimal values are supported."
msgstr "LINE1, LINE2 og LINE3 bruger faste bredder. For LINE:STACK angives en bredde i pixel; heltal eller decimalværdier understøttes."

#: include/global_form.php:1077
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Streger (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php:1082
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Modifikatoren dashes aktiverer stiplet linjestil."

#: include/global_form.php:1085
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Stregforskydning (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php:1090 include/global_form.php:1098
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Parameteren dash-offset angiver en forskydning ind i mønsteret, hvor stregen begynder."

#: include/global_form.php:1107
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Navnet på denne grafskabelon."

#: include/global_form.php:1114
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Flere forekomster"

#: include/global_form.php:1115
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Afkryds dette felt, hvis der kan være mere end én graf af denne type pr. enhed."

#: include/global_form.php:1122
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Test datakilder"

#: include/global_form.php:1123
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Afkryds dette felt, hvis du vil teste datakilderne, før de oprettes.  Når Test datakilder er aktiveret, oprettes grafen ikke, hvis datakilden ikke returnerer gyldige data.  Denne indstilling er vigtig, hvis du vil have en mere generisk enhedsskabelon, der kan indeholde flere grafskabeloner, som selektivt kan anvendes afhængigt af selve enhedens egenskaber.  Bemærk: Hvis du har et langvarigt script som datakilde, øges den tid, det tager at oprette grafer."

#: include/global_form.php:1147
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Angiv et navn til dette grafelementinput, og sørg for, at det er noget, du genkender."

#: include/global_form.php:1155
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Angiv en beskrivelse af dette grafelementinput, så det fremgår, hvad inputtet bruges til."

#: include/global_form.php:1162
msgid "Field Type"
msgstr "Felttype"

#: include/global_form.php:1163
msgid "How data is to be represented on the graph."
msgstr "Hvordan data skal repræsenteres på grafen."

#: include/global_form.php:1186
msgid "General Device Options"
msgstr "Generelle enhedsindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:1191
msgid "Give this host a meaningful description."
msgstr "Giv denne vært en sigende beskrivelse."

#: include/global_form.php:1198 include/global_form.php:1769
msgid "Fully qualified hostname or IP address for this device."
msgstr "Fuldt kvalificeret værtsnavn eller IP-adresse for denne enhed."

#: include/global_form.php:1206
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Enhedens fysiske placering.  Denne fritekst kan være et rum, en rackplacering osv."

#: include/global_form.php:1215
msgid "Poller Association"
msgstr "Poller-tilknytning"

#: include/global_form.php:1223
msgid "Device Site Association"
msgstr "Enhedens lokationstilknytning"

#: include/global_form.php:1224
msgid "What Site is this Device associated with."
msgstr "Hvilken lokation denne enhed er tilknyttet."

#: include/global_form.php:1233
msgid "Choose the Device Template to use to define the default Graph Templates and Data Queries associated with this Device."
msgstr "Vælg den enhedsskabelon, der skal bruges til at definere de standardgrafskabeloner og dataforespørgsler, der er knyttet til denne enhed."

#: include/global_form.php:1241
msgid "Number of Collection Threads"
msgstr "Antal indsamlingstråde"

#: include/global_form.php:1242
msgid "The number of concurrent threads to use for polling this device.  This applies to the Spine poller only."
msgstr "Antallet af samtidige tråde, der skal bruges til polling af denne enhed.  Dette gælder kun for Spine-polleren."

#: include/global_form.php:1249
msgid "Disable Device"
msgstr "Deaktivér enhed"

#: include/global_form.php:1250
msgid "Check this box to disable all checks for this host."
msgstr "Afkryds dette felt for at deaktivere alle kontroller for denne vært."

#: include/global_form.php:1263
msgid "Availability/Reachability Options"
msgstr "Indstillinger for tilgængelighed/nåbarhed"

#: include/global_form.php:1267 include/global_settings.php:811
msgid "Downed Device Detection"
msgstr "Registrering af nedbrudt enhed"

#: include/global_form.php:1268
msgid "The method Cacti will use to determine if a host is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Den metode, som Cacti bruger til at afgøre, om en vært er tilgængelig til polling.  <br><i>BEMÆRK: Det anbefales, at SNMP som minimum altid vælges.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php:1277
msgid "The type of ping packet to sent.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Typen af ping-pakke, der skal sendes.  <br><i>BEMÆRK: ICMP på Linux/UNIX kræver root-rettigheder.</i>  <br><i>BEMÆRK: TCP Ping Closed - Selv om TCP-ping ikke lykkes, kan enheden betragtes som OPPE.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php:1314 include/global_form.php:1806
msgid "Additional Options"
msgstr "Yderligere indstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:1318 include/global_form.php:1811 pollers.php:92
#: sites.php:157
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Noter"

#: include/global_form.php:1319 include/global_form.php:1812
msgid "Enter notes to this host."
msgstr "Angiv noter til denne vært."

#: include/global_form.php:1326
msgid "External ID"
msgstr "Eksternt ID"

#: include/global_form.php:1327
msgid "External ID for linking Cacti data to external monitoring systems."
msgstr "Eksternt id til at forbinde Cacti-data med eksterne overvågningssystemer."

#: include/global_form.php:1349
msgid "A useful name for this host template."
msgstr "Et brugbart navn til denne værtsskabelon."

#: include/global_form.php:1357
msgid "A suitable Class for the Device Template."
msgstr "En passende klasse til enhedsskabelonen."

#: include/global_form.php:1377
msgid "A name for this data query."
msgstr "Et navn til denne dataforespørgsel."

#: include/global_form.php:1385
msgid "A description for this data query."
msgstr "En beskrivelse af denne dataforespørgsel."

#: include/global_form.php:1392
msgid "XML Path"
msgstr "XML-sti"

#: include/global_form.php:1393
msgid "The full path to the XML file containing definitions for this data query."
msgstr "Den fulde sti til XML-filen, der indeholder definitionerne for denne dataforespørgsel."

#: include/global_form.php:1402
msgid "Choose the input method for this Data Query.  This input method defines how data is collected for each Device associated with the Data Query."
msgstr "Vælg inputmetoden for denne dataforespørgsel.  Denne inputmetode definerer, hvordan data indsamles for hver enhed, der er knyttet til dataforespørgslen."

#: include/global_form.php:1421
msgid "Choose the Graph Template to use for this Data Query Graph Template item."
msgstr "Vælg den grafskabelon, der skal bruges til dette grafskabelonelement i dataforespørgslen."

#: include/global_form.php:1450
msgid "A name for this associated graph."
msgstr "Et navn til denne tilknyttede graf."

#: include/global_form.php:1478
msgid "A useful name for this graph tree."
msgstr "Et brugbart navn til dette graftræ."

#: include/global_form.php:1485 include/global_form.php:2330
#: lib/api_automation.php:1612 tree.php:2040
msgid "Sorting Type"
msgstr "Sorteringstype"

#: include/global_form.php:1486 include/global_form.php:2331
msgid "Choose how items in this tree will be sorted."
msgstr "Vælg, hvordan elementerne i dette træ skal sorteres."

#: include/global_form.php:1492
msgid "Publish"
msgstr "Udgiv"

#: include/global_form.php:1493
msgid "Should this Tree be published for users to access?"
msgstr "Skal dette træ udgives, så brugerne kan få adgang til det?"

#: include/global_form.php:1533
msgid "An Email Address where the User can be reached."
msgstr "En e-mailadresse, hvor brugeren kan kontaktes."

#: include/global_form.php:1541
msgid "Enter the password for this user twice. Remember that passwords are case sensitive!"
msgstr "Angiv adgangskoden til denne bruger to gange. Husk, at adgangskoder skelner mellem store og små bogstaver!"

#: include/global_form.php:1549 user_group_admin.php:89
msgid "Determines if user is able to login."
msgstr "Afgør, om brugeren kan logge ind."

#: include/global_form.php:1555 tree.php:2419
msgid "Locked"
msgstr "Låst"

#: include/global_form.php:1556
msgid "Determines if the user account is locked."
msgstr "Afgør, om brugerkontoen er låst."

#: include/global_form.php:1561
msgid "Account Options"
msgstr "Kontoindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:1563
msgid "Set any user account specific options here."
msgstr "Angiv eventuelle kontospecifikke indstillinger her."

#: include/global_form.php:1567
msgid "Must Change Password at Next Login"
msgstr "Skal skifte adgangskode ved næste login"

#: include/global_form.php:1579
msgid "Maintain Custom Graph and User Settings"
msgstr "Vedligehold brugerdefinerede graf- og brugerindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:1586
msgid "Graph Options"
msgstr "Grafindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:1588
msgid "Set any graph specific options here."
msgstr "Angiv eventuelle grafspecifikke indstillinger her."

#: include/global_form.php:1592
msgid "User Has Rights to Tree View"
msgstr "Brugeren har rettigheder til trævisning"

#: include/global_form.php:1598
msgid "User Has Rights to List View"
msgstr "Brugeren har rettigheder til listevisning"

#: include/global_form.php:1604
msgid "User Has Rights to Preview View"
msgstr "Brugeren har rettigheder til eksempelvisning"

#: include/global_form.php:1611 user_group_admin.php:131
msgid "Login Options"
msgstr "Loginindstillinger"

#: include/global_form.php:1614
msgid "What to do when this user logs in."
msgstr "Hvad der skal ske, når denne bruger logger ind."

#: include/global_form.php:1619
msgid "Show the page that user pointed their browser to."
msgstr "Vis den side, som brugeren pegede sin browser på."

