msgstr "Begræns RRDfiles til RRA-mappen"

#: include/global_settings.php:2400
msgid "When checked, Cacti refuses to save, create or update an RRDfile whose path resolves outside the RRA directory ($config['rra_path'] in include/config.php, &lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra by default), following symbolic links. A symbolic link inside the RRA directory that points elsewhere is refused as well. Leave this unchecked if any Data Source uses a custom path outside the RRA directory, or those Data Sources will stop updating."
msgstr "Når markeret, nægter Cacti at gemme, oprette eller opdatere en RRDfile, hvis sti peger uden for RRA-mappen ($config['rra_path'] i include/config.php, som standard &lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra), idet symbolske links følges. Et symbolsk link inde i RRA-mappen, der peger andre steder hen, nægtes også. Lad denne indstilling være umarkeret, hvis en datakilde bruger en brugerdefineret sti uden for RRA-mappen, ellers holder disse datakilder op med at blive opdateret."

